## Environment Variables

Add to `backend/.env` (already documented in `.env.example`):

```env
AIRTABLE_SHARE_URL=https://airtable.com/appEGxhjno0HTpEco/shrUhtbnzZTPaR4Lk/tblACIQ9QNiVmoWSK
AIRTABLE_SCRAPE_CRON=*/30 * * * *
AIRTABLE_SCRAPE_ENABLED=true
```

