## API Endpoints

| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/airtable-deals` | Paginated list; query params: `state`, `min_price`, `max_price`, `industry`, `sort`, `order`, `limit`, `offset` |
| `GET` | `/api/airtable-deals/status` | Scraper health: `{ enabled, cron, isRunning, lastRun, lastResult }` |
| `POST` | `/api/airtable-deals/scrape` | Trigger a manual scrape immediately |

